sequenceDiagram
 participant C as Customer
 participant ID as Enterprise OIDC
 participant UI as Customer Portal
 participant API as Authenticated Integration API
 participant ERP as ERP and CRM
 participant LLM as Approved Inference Service
 participant H as Human Approver
 C->>ID: Authenticate
 ID-->>UI: Signed token
 UI->>API: Inquiry with bearer token
 API->>API: Verify signature, audience, scope, tenant
 API->>ERP: Tenant- and account-filtered lookup
 ERP-->>API: Allowlisted business facts
 API->>LLM: Minimized authorized facts + policy
 LLM-->>API: Draft + references
 API->>API: Validate/flag risk + audit
 alt Quote, hold, or commitment
 API->>H: Pending approval
 H-->>API: Approve or reject
 end
 API-->>UI: Reviewed response and case ID
 UI-->>C: Case update
